{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-5","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：棱锥","englishTitle":"Pyramids which are of the same height and have triangular bases are to one another as the bases.","book":12,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","contentId":"euclid-12-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c100835d21e3d46da3135b3dec5efc2067203d9044351131112ad0d522e02e81","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-5.statement","euclid-12-5.construction.1","euclid-12-5.proof.1","euclid-12-5.construction.2","euclid-12-5.proof.2","euclid-12-5.construction.3","euclid-12-5.construction.4","euclid-12-5.proof.3","euclid-12-5.proof.4","euclid-12-5.proof.5","euclid-12-5.proof.6","euclid-12-5.proof.7","euclid-12-5.proof.8","euclid-12-5.proof.9","euclid-12-5.proof.10","euclid-12-5.proof.11","euclid-12-5.proof.12","euclid-12-5.conclusion","euclid-12-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f36cd40d4bae8976e355a6a31ebf0ec8a97c4e046ea004ac2d52765356a2d26b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Pyramids which are of the same height and have triangular bases are to one another as the bases."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"金字塔的高度和三角形底边是底边的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61c297a98957a36f1c0af4bc2a084df622bb922bf9fd71c8331a834932d3d591","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be pyramids of the same height, of which the triangles ABC, DEF are the bases and the points G, H the vertices; I say that, as the base ABC is to the base DEF, so is the pyramid ABCG to the pyramid DEFH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"允许有同样高的金字塔,其中三角形ABC,DEF是底边,点G,H是顶峰;我说,底边,ABC对底边,DEF的比等于金字塔ABCG对金字塔DEFH的比"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ef7d43349074f33c555a811a446100c15342d76b6539e63ee1da608110eb10b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the pyramid ABCG is not to the pyramid DEFH as the base ABC is to the base DEF, then, as the base ABC is to the base DEF, so will the pyramid ABCG be either to some solid less than the pyramid DEFH or to a greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果金字塔ABCG不是金字塔DEFH,底边 ABC是底边 DEF,那么,底边 ABC是底边 DEF,那么金字塔ABCG不是比金字塔DEFH更固态的就是更大的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb305b13164345a33968b5fe3a8f06ec0bad2f98f1f03b2789a04eb56f284f51","citations":["euclid-12-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it, first, be in that ratio to a less solid W, and let the pyramid DEFH be divided into two pyramids equal to one another and similar to the whole and into two equal prisms; then the two prisms are greater than the half of the whole pyramid. [[XII. 3](/principles/euclid-12-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它与W的坚固度相比,让金字塔DEFH被分为两个金字塔,两个金字塔等同,一个与整个金字塔相似,另一个同化;然后,两个棱镜大于整个金字塔的一半。 [[XII. 3](/principles/euclid-12-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e8bcad15db7f9eac7ad47c21fc559f237d959612b05a45656be3ac0b444322c","citations":["euclid-10-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let the pyramids arising from the division be similarly divided, and let this be done continually until there are left over from the pyramid DEFH some pyramids which are less than the excess by which the pyramid DEFH exceeds the solid W. [[X. 1](/principles/euclid-10-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由这一分割产生的金字塔也进行类似的分割,并让这种划分持续进行,直到金字塔DEFH留下一些金字塔,这些金字塔不到金字塔DEFH超过W固体的多余部分。 [[X. 1](/principles/euclid-10-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c8fcbe22af0213f5d0ec85d80c86f52d2e420e2d85af8a0a339f47d4fe6d4d16","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let such be left, and let them be, for the sake of argument, DQRS, STUH; therefore the remainders, the prisms in the pyramid DEFH, are greater than the solid W."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任由它们去讨论,为了争论,让它们去讨论DQRS,STUH;因此,金字塔DEFH的棱镜比W固体大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67751c68cc704be710ef3f36fbc3d25f8517fa118cf2e471ed2f61518a326f1c","citations":["euclid-12-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the pyramid ABCG also be divided similarly, and a similar number of times, with the pyramid DEFH; therefore, as the base ABC is to the base DEF, so are the prisms in the pyramid ABCG to the prisms in the pyramid DEFH. [[XII. 4](/principles/euclid-12-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABCG金字塔也以类似次数与DEFH金字塔相分割;因此,底边 ABC是底边 DEF,金字塔ABCG的棱镜也是DEFH [[XII. 4](/principles/euclid-12-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2fd8b1d13864fb97f36e63bcd181f3b34c5f2cb1b9a99c2bfa69edde97e549ce","citations":["euclid-5-11","euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the base ABC is to the base DEF, so also is the pyramid ABCG to the solid W; therefore also, as the pyramid ABCG is to the solid W, so are the prisms in the pyramid ABCG to the prisms in the pyramid DEFH; [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] therefore, alternately, as the pyramid ABCG is to the prisms in it, so is the solid W to the prisms in the pyramid DEFH. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,由于底边 ABC是底边 DEF,金字塔ABCG是W,因此,金字塔ABCG是W,金字塔ABCG是DEFH,金字塔ABCG的棱镜也是DEFH,因此,金字塔ABCG与金字塔DEFH的棱镜之比,两者之比等于W。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee060d7046511c0c41ebb134701594a81e80f5b41e1b90e43ac2c5aaf26e964b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the pyramid ABCG is greater than the prisms in it; therefore the solid W is also greater than the prisms in the pyramid DEFH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但金字塔ABCG比棱镜大, 所以,固态W也比金字塔DEFH的棱镜大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7e45d6b69d5ea21ce07c423c2a7249b0b963ea402798736d9d191c715abfd5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但情况也更少:这是不可能做到的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41789308c49e0baa2bbfede5393aa369324edda48cf46e8b318285e13f885213","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the prism ABCG is not to any solid less than the pyramid DEFH as the base ABC is to the base DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABCG棱镜的固态不会低于DEFH金字塔,因为底边 ABC是底边 DEF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6acf0510c8866b41240485a2efe81b72554c01770e1be86a2f11037d4d7d17d6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly it can be proved that neither is the pyramid DEFH to any solid less than the pyramid ABCG as the base DEF is to the base ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,可以证明金字塔DEFH至金字塔ABCG的固态都不如金字塔DEFH,因为底边 DEF是底边 ABC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34571c505f06ba036c3e212710785703c2fcf2141524b225eb7efce9e89ad90d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that neither is the pyramid ABCG to any solid greater than the pyramid DEFH as the base ABC is to the base DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说金字塔ABCG比金字塔DEFH都大 因为它是底边、DEF"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"005b2fbec07429df92e049cc9884eb3337cdc346fe81d9dc32a9a7b0cfef1398","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be in that ratio to a greater solid W; therefore, inversely, as the base DEF is to the base ABC, so is the solid W to the pyramid ABCG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,让它与更大的W固体的比成正比;因此,底边 DEF对底边 ABC的比等于W对金字塔ABCG的比"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffc3e36eb6f614992fbf9d0d3098c8e226a2c6b59517b518a833a58623cdfada","citations":["euclid-12-2","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the solid W is to the solid ABCG, so is the pyramid DEFH to some solid less than the pyramid ABCG, as was before proved; [[XII. 2, Lemma](/principles/euclid-12-2)] therefore also, as the base DEF is to the base ABC, so is the pyramid DEFH to some solid less than the pyramid ABCG: [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] which was proved absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如以前所证明的那样,W对ABCG对W的固体比例等于DEFH对比金字塔ABCG的某种固体比例;因此,底边 DEF对底边 ABC的比等于DEFH对比ABCG的金字塔ABCG的某种固体比例,这被证明是荒谬的 [[XII. 2, 引理](/principles/euclid-12-2)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df22ef3c1dfdc89fb2333df2ef83958f3db5fc2cada1bbdee4ce095d91d0be40","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the pyramid ABCG is not to any solid greater than the pyramid DEFH as the base ABC is to the base DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,金字塔ABCG的固态不会大于金字塔DEFH,因为底边 ABC是底边 DEF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52527ffb8512f6ff52f8245872f718af5a7b2d9f0831c7cc2a4ce77b559b80ca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was proved that neither is it in that ratio to a less solid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,两者的比例都不如那么牢固。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":17,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b537488ea1a87c30b0472d5eb164d1124e69a3d4a6be0a763d87a6671c0ac29","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the base ABC is to the base DEF, so is the pyramid ABCG to the pyramid DEFH. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,底边 ABC对底边 DEF的比等于金字塔ABCG对金字塔DEFH的比"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-5.source","contentId":"euclid-12-5","revisionId":"euclid-12-5@raw-c100835d21e3d46d","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c263bbe43ec95303ea24f433bf1b87574db177601874231561bb872096a5981","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-5:euclid-12-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-5.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"XII. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-5:euclid-10-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-5.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"e